### 관리자 로그인
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "securePass123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", "Bearer " + response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 회원 로그인
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "securePass123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", "Bearer " + response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 쿠폰 정책 생성 - 고정일 기준
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/coupons/policies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "couponName": "전메뉴 10% 할인 쿠폰",
  "discountType": "FIXED",
  "discountValue": 10000,
  "minOrderPrice": 30000,
  "maxDiscountPrice": 10000,
  "expirationType": "FIXED_PERIOD",
  "issueMode": "NORMAL",
  "activeStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "startDate": "2025-09-20T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2025-10-31T23:59:59",
  "perUserLimit": 1,
  "totalQuantity": 100
}

### 쿠폰 정책 생성 - 쿠폰 생성일 기준
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/coupons/policies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "couponName": "전메뉴 10% 할인 쿠폰",
  "discountType": "FIXED",
  "discountValue": 10000,
  "minOrderPrice": 30000,
  "maxDiscountPrice": 10000,
  "validDays" : 90,
  "expirationType": "COUPON_CREATED",
  "issueMode": "NORMAL",
  "activeStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "startDate": "2025-09-20T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2025-10-31T23:59:59",
  "perUserLimit": 1,
  "totalQuantity": 100
}

### 쿠폰 정책 생성 - 발급일 기준
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/coupons/policies
Content-Type: application/json
