}

### 쿠폰 정책 조회
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/coupons/policies/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 실물 쿠폰 대량 생산 - 일반 쿠폰
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "couponPolicyId": 1,
  "quantity": 50,
  "prefix" : "2025-BIGEVENT",
  "type" : "ONLINE",
  "issueMode" : "NORMAL"
}

### 실물 쿠폰 대량 생산 - 선착순
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "couponPolicyId": 2,
  "quantity": 10,
  "prefix" : "2025BIGEVENT",
  "type" : "ONLINE",
  "issueMode" : "FIRST_COME"
}

